{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "引"}
{"id": null, "n": "0001017", "target": "#nkr_note_mod_0001017", "type": "mod", "text": "西天譯經三藏朝散大夫試鴻臚少卿傳教大師臣【大】，三藏傳教大師【宋】【元】，宋西天譯經三藏朝散大夫試鴻臚少卿傳教大師臣【明】"}
{"id": null, "n": "0001018", "target": "#nkr_note_mod_0001018", "type": "mod", "text": "譯經【大】，〔－〕【明】"}
{"id": null, "n": "0001019", "target": "#nkr_note_mod_0001019", "type": "mod", "text": "臣【大】，〔－〕【明】"}
{"id": null, "n": "0002001", "target": "#nkr_note_mod_0002001", "type": "mod", "text": "尼【大】，哩尼【宋】【元】【明】"}
{"id": null, "n": "0002002", "target": "#nkr_note_mod_0002002", "type": "mod", "text": "唧【大】，即【明】"}
{"id": null, "n": "0002003", "target": "#nkr_note_mod_0002003", "type": "mod", "text": "引【大】，〔－〕【宋】【元】【明】"}
{"id": null, "n": "0002004", "target": "#nkr_note_mod_0002004", "type": "mod", "text": "尼【大】，呪【宋】"}
{"id": null, "n": "0001016", "target": "#nkr_note_orig_0001016", "type": "orig", "text": "【原】麗本"}
{"id": null, "n": "0001017", "target": "#nkr_note_orig_0001017", "type": "orig", "text": "（西天…臣）二十字＝（三藏傳教大師）六字【宋】【元】，（宋）＋西【明】"}
{"id": null, "n": "0001018", "target": "#nkr_note_orig_0001018", "type": "orig", "text": "〔譯經〕－【明】"}
{"id": null, "n": "0001019", "target": "#nkr_note_orig_0001019", "type": "orig", "text": "〔臣〕－【明】"}
{"id": null, "n": "0002001", "target": "#nkr_note_orig_0002001", "type": "orig", "text": "（哩）＋尼【三】"}
{"id": null, "n": "0002002", "target": "#nkr_note_orig_0002002", "type": "orig", "text": "唧＝即【明】"}
{"id": null, "n": "0002003", "target": "#nkr_note_orig_0002003", "type": "orig", "text": "〔引〕－【三】"}
{"id": null, "n": "0002004", "target": "#nkr_note_orig_0002004", "type": "orig", "text": "尼＝呪【宋】"}
